# Migrated from the source repository's .gitignore
# (ProfessorZhi/serveros-research-exchange@bdde66b349076467c05d9c3848b7f54dc81a5558)
# so that this subtree keeps the same local-artifact and secret boundary.
#
# The root .gitignore already covers the ServerOS-wide rules (`__pycache__/`,
# `.env`, `.env.*`, `*.pem`, `*.key`). The entries below are the source rules
# plus the test artifacts this protocol implementation produces when its
# mechanism tests run here. Nothing in this file tracks business material:
# packets, inputs and results live in the private hwz-records checkout.

# Python bytecode and test caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# local virtual environments
.venv/
venv/

# secrets — never commit (source rules)
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
